# Markdown belongs to this repository's own hook. At `proseWrap: never` the two
# would largely agree rather than undo each other; the reason to exclude it is
# the documentation itself. Prettier formats the contents of a fence tagged
# `markdown`, and the README illustrates its own directives inside them, so a
# run pushes a blank line into the `<!-- unwrap-ignore -->` example whose whole
# point is the break below it. At `never` it folds the badge block as well.
*.md
